 "body": "<div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><p id=\"design-announcer\" class=\"sr-only\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></p><div class=\"site gh\" data-theme=\"gilded-hour\" data-bottom-bar=\"\" data-lifecycle=\"TEASER\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\" target=\"_self\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Skip to content</span></a><header class=\"gh-header\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"header\" data-bl-label=\"Menu\"><nav class=\"gh-frieze\" aria-label=\"Site\" data-bl-k=\"nav\" data-bl-label=\"Site\"><ul class=\"gh-frieze__side gh-frieze__side--left\" data-fit-row=\"\"><li><a class=\"gh-nav__link\" href=\"/our-story\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Our Story</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"gh-nav__link\" href=\"/our-adventures\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Our Adventures</span></span></a></li></ul><a class=\"gh-plaque-link\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"gh-plaque gh-plaque--mono\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">S+T</span></span><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Sara + Tyler</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"label\">: </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Home</span></span></a><ul class=\"gh-frieze__side gh-frieze__side--right\" data-fit-row=\"\"><li><a class=\"gh-nav__link\" href=\"/sign-in\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Sign in</span></a></li></ul><div class=\"gh-frieze__menu\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"gh-nav__menu\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"site-menu\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"></path></svg><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Menu</span></span></button><dialog id=\"site-menu\" class=\"gh-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_4d5esneknelb_\" data-bl-k=\"dialog\" data-bl-label=\"Menu\"><div class=\"gh-dialog__panel\" data-bl-s=\"\"><div class=\"gh-dialog__header\" data-bl-b=\"\"><h2 id=\"_R_4d5esneknelb_\" class=\"gh-dialog__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Menu</span></h2><button type=\"button\" class=\"gh-btn gh-btn--ghost gh-dialog__close\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Close</span></button></div><div class=\"gh-dialog__body\"><ul class=\"gh-menu\"><li><a class=\"gh-menu__link\" href=\"/\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Home</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"gh-menu__link\" href=\"/our-story\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Our Story</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"gh-menu__link\" href=\"/our-adventures\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Our Adventures</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"gh-menu__link\" href=\"/sign-in\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Sign in</span></a></li></ul></div></div></dialog></div><span hidden=\"\" data-nav-fit=\"whole\"></span></nav></header><main id=\"main\" class=\"gh-main\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-bl-k=\"main\" data-bl-label=\"Terms of use\"><article class=\"credits legal\" aria-labelledby=\"page-title\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Terms of use\"><header class=\"credits__head\" data-bl-k=\"header\" data-bl-label=\"Terms of use\"><p class=\"credits__eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">For our guests</span></p><h1 id=\"page-title\" class=\"credits__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Terms of use</span></h1><p class=\"credits__lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">By using this private wedding website you agree to these simple rules. They exist to keep the site useful for Sara, Tyler, and their guests.</span></p><p class=\"credits__lede\"><small><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Last updated </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">November 1, 2026</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></small></p></header><section id=\"purpose\" class=\"credits__section\" aria-labelledby=\"purpose-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"What this site is\"><h2 id=\"purpose-title\" class=\"credits__h2\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What this site is</span></h2><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">kendrick.wedding is a private site for Sara and Tyler’s wedding. What you see here is wedding information for their guests and the couple, not for resale or scraping.</span></p></section><section id=\"account\" class=\"credits__section\" aria-labelledby=\"account-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Your account\"><h2 id=\"account-title\" class=\"credits__h2\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Your account</span></h2><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sign-in is by invitation. Use your own email or phone, or the social sign-in option, only to access your household’s information. Do not try to sign in as someone else.</span></p></section><section id=\"content\" class=\"credits__section\" aria-labelledby=\"content-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Photos and messages\"><h2 id=\"content-title\" class=\"credits__h2\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Photos and messages</span></h2><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Photos, stories, and uploads may include people who expect privacy at a wedding. Do not repost others’ images or details without their permission. Professional and guest media on the site may carry separate rights — see</span><!-- --> <a href=\"/credits\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Photo credits</span></a><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></p></section><section id=\"availability\" class=\"credits__section\" aria-labelledby=\"availability-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Availability\"><h2 id=\"availability-title\" class=\"credits__h2\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Availability</span></h2><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We try to keep the site running smoothly but do not guarantee uninterrupted access. Features may change as the weekend approaches.</span></p></section><section id=\"privacy\" class=\"credits__section\" aria-labelledby=\"privacy-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Privacy\"><h2 id=\"privacy-title\" class=\"credits__h2\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Privacy</span></h2><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Our </span><a href=\"/privacy\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Privacy</span></a><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> page describes what we collect and how to ask for changes or deletion.</span></p></section><section id=\"contact\" class=\"credits__section\" aria-labelledby=\"contact-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Questions\"><h2 id=\"contact-title\" class=\"credits__h2\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Questions</span></h2><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Questions about these terms? Ask Sara and Tyler through the site or your usual way of reaching them.</span></p></section></article></main><nav class=\"gh-panel\" aria-label=\"Quick actions\" style=\"--cells:2\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"nav\" data-bl-label=\"Quick actions\"><a class=\"gh-panel__cell\" href=\"/our-story\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M4 5h7a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v13a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4zM20 5h-7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v13a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h7z\"></path></svg><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Story</span></span></a><a class=\"gh-panel__cell\" href=\"/our-adventures\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M12 21a9 9 0 1 0 0-18 9 9 0 0 0 0 18zM15 9l-2 6-4 2 2-6z\"></path></svg><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Adventures</span></span></a></nav><footer class=\"gh-footer\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"footer\"><div class=\"gh-footer__inner\"><p class=\"gh-footer__names\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler</span></p><p class=\"gh-footer__signin\"><a class=\"gh-